  "description": "Streamable HTTP MCP (Model Context Protocol) server host for WebReaper. Exposes scrape / map / extract / extract_with_prompt / crawl as MCP tools over HTTP, so URL-based MCP clients (n8n, hosted agents) can reach WebReaper. Sibling to the stdio WebReaper.Mcp satellite, reusing its tools. Self-run, single-tenant, bearer-token auth. ADR-0086.",
